  "notes": [
    "The document prints no version or year. Version 'Fall 2016' / effectiveFromYear 16 is inferred from note 5 ('BAN 205 and HIS 103 is compulsory for students admitted in Fall 2016 or later'); the map as printed includes BAN205 and HIS103.",
    "Students admitted before Fall 2016 may instead take any two of ECO101, ECO104, SOC101, PSY210, POL210, LAW200, MGT210, PHI315 in place of BAN205 and HIS103 (note 5). Not encoded as alternatives.",
    "The document prints no category names; categories were grouped by subject (General Education, Math & Science, Major Core, Major Elective, Capstone).",
    "Semesters 1-9 follow the 'Semester credits' blocks (three per year). The senior (fourth) year page has no semester split, so senior-year rows have semester null.",
    "The cover page says the senior year is 30 credits, but the senior-year page totals 35 credits and the overall total 149 = 33 + 40 + 41 + 35, so 35 was used.",
    "CEE100, MAT116 and ENG102 are printed as NON CREDIT (ENG102 'exempted based on English score in admission test'). CEE498 Internship is printed as 0 credits and stored as nonCredit.",
    "Major electives: 'Any four from these 15 courses, 4 x 3 cr. = 12 credits; student should have finished 120 credits to take any elective course'. Four rows (codes CEE410, CEE431, CEE433, CEE435), each listing the other 14 options as alternatives. Each row's prereq is 120 credits plus that code's own printed prerequisite; the options' own prerequisites are: CEE410 none, CEE431 CEE331, CEE433 CEE331, CEE435 CEE430, CEE437 CEE212, CEE439 CEE340, CEE465/467/473 CEE360, CEE475 'MAT 15 CR' (unclear, probably 15 credits of MAT courses; not encoded), CEE477 CEE260, CEE479/ENV309/ENV408 ENV209, CEE490 none.",
    "Elective credits are 3 each as stated in the side note; CEE410 and CEE490 have no printed credit in their own rows.",
    "CEE209/CEE209L are printed as '(or CEE 209)' alternatives to ENV209/ENV209L; the CEE370 and CEE370L prerequisites print 'CEE 209', which resolves to the ENV209 alternative.",
    "Prerequisites printed on two lines or with commas (e.g. 'CEE 210, CEE 214') are read as all required.",
    "CEE499 and ENV455 require '125 CR.'; CEE498 requires '135 CR.'.",
    "Faculty initials column was not transcribed."
